---
title: "Introduction to Multimedia"
code: "ART-130"
category: "arts"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces the student to the basic components of multimedia: text, graphics, animation, sound, and video, and explores how they combine to create a multimedia product. Emphasizes the design aspects of multimedia projects and teaches the techniques required to develop a presentation. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 4hours per week. Computer literacy is suggested.
